- a regression in the gate or the writer swap silently stops classification for the rest of the session;
- a rehydration regression is exactly the windowed data-loss bug in the other thread — a test that opens the session **windowed** (`_repo.open(metadata, windowed: true)`), slides the snapshot out of residency, appends a classified message, and asserts the pre-boundary entries survive would have caught it before review.

